    <description>Slim white glazed vase, 0.110 m across and 0.236 m tall, authored from primitives. Replaces the squirrel figurine beside it on the living_room bookshelf, sized to the squirrel at the 1.5x scale the world intends (0.151 x 0.212 x 0.199). A narrower, taller profile than decor_vase so the pair reads as a considered arrangement.</description>
